<mxCell id="10" value="&lt;b&gt;PHASE 1: ROUTINE BILLING &amp; PRE-DUE MONITORING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Billing on 1st–15th &amp; 16th–End&lt;br/&gt;• Bi-monthly Statement Dispatches&lt;br/&gt;• Proactive Sales Follow-ups&lt;br/&gt;• Standard 30-Day Credit Horizon" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
